DESCRIPTION:It’s that time of year again\, CFR is here!\n\nThe champions
 hip is in town\, bringing Edmonton’s biggest Western celebration to life
 . Whether you're a lifelong rodeo fan or discovering it for the first time
 \, CFR is more than just a competition\; it’s a city-wide celebration of
  music\, fashion\, and elite athleticism! Plus\, you don’t need a ticket
  to the dirt to enjoy the Western spirit!\n\nCanadian Country Expo A six-d
 ay celebration of Western lifestyle featuring a massive trade show and the
  Western Showcase. Explore boutique shopping\, tack\, art\, and furniture\
 , plus catch live experiences like Youth Rodeo\, Bullfighting\, contestant
  autograph sessions\, and daily buffet offerings. There's something new ar
 ound every corner!\n\nCFR Backroads Series The CFR Backroads Series is a c
 itywide celebration of live music in Edmonton\, leading up to and during C
 anadian Finals Rodeo. Catch 16 shows at 13 venues\, where over 35 artists 
 will take the stage\, showcasing the best of country and roots music! From
  intimate spaces to iconic music rooms and neighbourhood stages\, every ev
 ent is free to attend\, making it easy to experience the rodeo spirit thro
 ugh live music. Featuring homegrown Alberta talent all the way to the reac
 hes of Victoria\, BC and Nashville\, Tennessee. The CFR Backroads series i
 s presented by the Canadian Finals Rodeo\, supported by the City of Edmont
 on and Explore Edmonton\, and produced by Bird Creatives.\n\nThe Tailgate 
 Party (Ice District\, Rogers Place) The ultimate pre-show gathering spot w
 ith live music\, interactive displays\, and great food and drinks. It's th
 e perfect place to get into the rodeo spirit before the main performance.\
 n\nThe After-Party When the competition ends\, the energy keeps going with
  live country music and dancing in the Ice District Fan Tent. Expect a hig
 h-energy crowd and late-night celebrations!\n\nCommunity Pancake Breakfast
  – celebrating the 52nd Annual Canadian Finals Rodeo\n\nOn Saturday\, Oc
 tober 10\, 2026\, from 8:00 AM to 11:00 AM\, the Edmonton Inn & Conference
  Centre will host a free morning of family-friendly fun\, featuring pancak
 es\, live music\, a petting zoo\, glitter tattoos\, a custom hat bar\, pri
 zes and more. A free shuttle to the 11:00 AM matinée rodeo at Rogers Plac
 e will depart at 10:30 AM\, with limited availability on a first come\, fi
 rst served basis\; rodeo tickets are sold separately. The event is present
 ed by the Kingsway District Association and Edmonton Destination Marketing
  Hotels Ltd.\n\nInformation about the chili cook off can be found here: ht
 tps://www.cfr.ca/schedule/the-great-canadian-cfr-chili-cook-off !\n\nCFR s
 howcases the best of rodeo sport\, from powerful roughstock rides to light
 ning-fast timed events and precision women’s competitions.\n\nEVENT INFO
 RMATION\nSchedule: Saturday\, October 10\, 2026 at 8:00 AM–11:00 AM\nLoc
 ation: Rogers Place - 10220 104 Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nExplore Edm
 onton: https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/canadian-finals-rodeo-cf
 r-week
LAST-MODIFIED:20261008T231952Z
