X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>It’s that time of year again\, CFR is he
 re!</p><p>The championship is in town\, bringing Edmonton’s biggest West
 ern celebration to life. Whether you&#x27\;re a lifelong rodeo fan or disc
 overing it for the first time\, CFR is more than just a competition\; it
 ’s a city-wide celebration of music\, fashion\, and elite athleticism! P
 lus\, you don’t need a ticket to the dirt to enjoy the Western spirit!</
 p><p>Canadian Country Expo A six-day celebration of Western lifestyle feat
 uring a massive trade show and the Western Showcase. Explore boutique shop
 ping\, tack\, art\, and furniture\, plus catch live experiences like Youth
  Rodeo\, Bullfighting\, contestant autograph sessions\, and daily buffet o
 fferings. There&#x27\;s something new around every corner!</p><p>CFR Backr
 oads Series The CFR Backroads Series is a citywide celebration of live mus
 ic in Edmonton\, leading up to and during Canadian Finals Rodeo. Catch 16 
 shows at 13 venues\, where over 35 artists will take the stage\, showcasin
 g the best of country and roots music! From intimate spaces to iconic musi
 c rooms and neighbourhood stages\, every event is free to attend\, making 
 it easy to experience the rodeo spirit through live music. Featuring homeg
 rown Alberta talent all the way to the reaches of Victoria\, BC and Nashvi
 lle\, Tennessee. The CFR Backroads series is presented by the Canadian Fin
 als Rodeo\, supported by the City of Edmonton and Explore Edmonton\, and p
 roduced by Bird Creatives.</p><p>The Tailgate Party (Ice District\, Rogers
  Place) The ultimate pre-show gathering spot with live music\, interactive
  displays\, and great food and drinks. It&#x27\;s the perfect place to get
  into the rodeo spirit before the main performance.</p><p>The After-Party 
 When the competition ends\, the energy keeps going with live country music
  and dancing in the Ice District Fan Tent. Expect a high-energy crowd and 
 late-night celebrations!</p><p>Community Pancake Breakfast – celebrating
  the 52nd Annual Canadian Finals Rodeo</p><p>On Saturday\, October 10\, 20
 26\, from 8:00 AM to 11:00 AM\, the Edmonton Inn &amp\; Conference Centre 
 will host a free morning of family-friendly fun\, featuring pancakes\, liv
 e music\, a petting zoo\, glitter tattoos\, a custom hat bar\, prizes and 
 more. A free shuttle to the 11:00 AM matinée rodeo at Rogers Place will d
 epart at 10:30 AM\, with limited availability on a first come\, first serv
 ed basis\; rodeo tickets are sold separately. The event is presented by th
 e Kingsway District Association and Edmonton Destination Marketing Hotels 
 Ltd.</p><p>Information about the chili cook off can be found here: https:/
 /www.cfr.ca/schedule/the-great-canadian-cfr-chili-cook-off !</p><p>CFR sho
 wcases the best of rodeo sport\, from powerful roughstock rides to lightni
 ng-fast timed events and precision women’s competitions.</p><h3>Event In
 formation</h3><ul><li><strong>Schedule:</strong> Saturday\, October 10\, 2
 026 at 8:00 AM–11:00 AM</li><li><strong>Location:</strong> Rogers Place 
 - 10220 104 Ave\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA</li><li><strong>Explore Edmonton
 :</strong> https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/canadian-finals-rode
 o-cfr-week</li></ul>
